#: ../../source/docs/common-acknowledgments.rst:5
#: 939fdbb4cd194872b6bed1027d63ec47
msgid "Acknowledgements"
msgstr "致谢"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acknowledgments.rst:7
#: b70ddc331e1740e9ab17b21817dcb1aa
msgid ""
"The project is the result of an immense amount of effort from software and "
"hardware engineers, testers, web developers, documenters and many others."
msgstr "本项目凝聚了软硬件工程师、测试人员、网页开发者、文档编写者以及众多其他贡献者的大量心血。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acknowledgments.rst:9
#: e17c0575e4314cc08924fccba76202e5
msgid ""
"These days ArduPilot is financially supported by our `Partners "
"<https://ardupilot.org/ardupilot/docs/common-partners.html>`__ and "
":ref:`individuals <common-donation>` but in the early days when ArduPilot "
"was still growing up it was primarily `3DR <https://3dr.com/>`__ (a.k.a. "
"\"3DRobotics\") that provided support.  This sponsorship paid the salaries "
"of some of the core development team, hosting infrastructure for the project"
" websites, and provided hardware as needed.  Thanks 3DR!"
msgstr ""
"如今，ArduPilot 主要由我们的 `合作伙伴 <https://ardupilot.org/ardupilot/docs/common-"
"partners.html>`__ 和 :ref:`个人贡献者 <common-donation>` 提供财务支持，但在 ArduPilot "
"成长初期，主要是 `3DR "
"<https://3dr.com/>`__（即「3DRobotics」）给予了大力支持。这份赞助支付了部分核心开发团队成员的薪资、项目网站的托管基础设施费用，并提供了所需硬件。感谢"
" 3DR！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acknowledgments.rst:11
#: 53f102148a2f42858176cf25d28629cf
msgid ""
"We also want to acknowledge `Helpmonks <https://helpmonks.com>`__ for "
"providing their Bliss plan free of cost. Managing e-mail in ArduPilot's team"
" is now easier."
msgstr ""
"我们还要感谢 `Helpmonks <https://helpmonks.com>`__ 免费提供其 Bliss 方案，使 ArduPilot "
"团队的邮件管理更加便捷。"
